      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The argument that forcing pronoun adoption is exclusionary is a common but ultimately weak defense against the clear reality that silencing or ignoring gender identity creates a hostile work environment. While older staff may feel uncomfortable, the cost of excluding LGBTQ+ employees or those who identify outside the binary is far higher than the temporary friction of learning new norms. A truly inclusive culture requires leaders to proactively educate their teams rather than retreat into outdated comfort zones that actively harm diversity and inclusion.",
