      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "There is absolutely no middle ground when it comes to respecting gender identity, because forcing anyone to ignore their own identity is inherently harmful and creates a toxic environment. Companies that try to \"balance\" opposing views by ignoring the needs of LGBTQ+ employees are not being neutral; they are actively choosing to exclude a significant portion of their workforce, which leads to higher turnover and legal risks. The only way to truly balance perspectives is to prioritize the rights of all employees to be treated with dignity, which means adopting inclusive policies as a standard, not an option.",
